    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "Making room for an interest · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to choose a shared leisure activity and explain a compromise.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U3-12-required-speaking-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U3-12-required-speaking-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Making room for an interest · 1: Explain the practical problem and your proposed response to an absent partner. State one constraint or condition and explain how it changes the plan.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "学校星期六有篮球比赛，我很想去。我在饭店工作，星期六下午不能休息，以为这次没有机会打球，只能听朋友说比赛的事。\n\n朋友给我看了时间，比赛是晚上七点开始，不是下午。我六点下班，饭店离体育馆很近，走路十分钟就到。我这才知道可以去。\n\n星期六下班以后，我先吃了一点儿东西，再去了体育馆。朋友已经在球场等我，给我一杯水，说还有时间，可以先练一会儿。\n\n开始打球了，我和一个学生打，朋友在旁边看。打完以后，我得分没有那个学生多，有点儿不高兴。朋友说我今天能来打球，已经很好。\n\n喝完水，我又和朋友练了一会儿，觉得下班以后也有机会运动。这次虽然得分不多，下次我会先看清楚比赛几点开始，再决定自己能不能来。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My problem and proposed response follow the source."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I connected a real condition or constraint to the result."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
